MISSION BRIEF — ACTIVE ASSIGNMENT
Konohagakure Mission Assignment Desk

Mission ID: KL-ACT-0442
Rank: B
Team: Squad assigned by roster (Chunin lead + two)
Client: Fire Country merchants' guild
Objective: Escort a supply caravan from Konohagakure to the eastern
trade town and back, protecting it from the bandit groups reported on
the forest road.

Threat Assessment: Elevated. Recent reports of an armed bandit band, one
member possibly a rogue chunin. No confirmed missing-nin involvement.

Rules of Engagement: Protect the client and cargo first. Avoid civilian
casualties. Capture over kill where feasible; deliver any captured
rogue-nin to the village for processing.

Reporting: Check in by messenger hawk at the halfway waypoint. File a
full debrief on return per the mission debrief template. Team lead holds
discretion to abort if the threat exceeds a B-rank profile.
